	// HYPOTHESIS-3: Session override (0.87/0.13) with CacheHitRate bonus preserves multiturn cache reuse for long-prefix sessions
	// MECHANISM-3: Multi-turn sessions benefit from consistent instance routing to avoid KV recomputation; CacheHitRate tiebreaker steers to historically warm instances
	// EXPECT-3: multiturn_e2e_ms < 161
